msgid "Triton-Ascend调试指南"
msgstr "Triton-Ascend Debugging Guide"

msgid "1 引言"
msgstr "1 Introduction"

msgid "本文档为 **Triton-Ascend调试指南**，面向参与Triton与昇腾（Ascend）NPU适配开发的工程师，系统性地介绍在Triton-Ascend编译与运行过程中常用的调试方法与工具。"
msgstr "This document is the **Triton-Ascend Debugging Guide**. It targets engineers involved in the adaptation and development of Triton and Ascend NPUs. The guide systematically introduces the debugging methods and tools commonly used during Triton-Ascend compilation and running."

msgid "全文内容概览如下："
msgstr "The overview of the content is as follows:"

msgid "章节"
msgstr "Chapter"

msgid "主要内容"
msgstr "Main Content"

msgid "**1. 概述**"
msgstr "**1. Overview**"

msgid "说明调试的核心目标（聚焦 `ttir.mlir` → `ttadapter.mlir` 转换），并对常见问题进行分类指引。"
msgstr "Describes the core goals of debugging (focusing on the `ttir.mlir` → `ttadapter.mlir` conversion) and provides categorized guidance for common issues."

msgid "**2. 编译流程概览**"
msgstr "**2. Compilation Process Overview**"

msgid "介绍Triton-Ascend端到端编译链的关键阶段，为后续调试提供上下文基础。"
msgstr "This section introduces the key stages of the Triton-Ascend end-to-end compilation pipeline, providing a contextual foundation for subsequent debugging."

msgid "**3. 临时文件指引**"
msgstr "**3. Temporary File Guidelines**"

msgid "详解编译过程中生成的中间文件（如 `.mlir`、`.ll`、`.o` 等）的存储位置与用途，便于人工检查。"
msgstr "Detail the storage locations and uses of intermediate files (for example, `.mlir`, `.ll`, and `.o`) generated during compilation to facilitate manual inspection."

msgid "**4. 解释器模式**"
msgstr "**4. Interpreter Mode**"

msgid "介绍如何通过 `TRITON_INTERPRET=1` 在CPU上运行kernel，作为NPU计算结果的精度基准。"
msgstr "This section describes how to run the kernel on the CPU using `TRITON_INTERPRET=1` as an accuracy baseline for NPU computation results."

msgid "**5. 调试方法**"
msgstr "**5. Debugging Methods**"

msgid "提供多种实用调试手段：静态/运行时打印、编译错误调试方法。"
msgstr "Multiple practical debugging methods are provided: static/runtime printing and compilation error debugging methods."

msgid "**附录A**"
msgstr "**Appendix A**"

msgid "常用环境变量速查表，提升调试效率。"
msgstr "A quick reference table of common environment variables improves debugging efficiency."

msgid "建议开发者结合具体问题，按需查阅对应章节，以高效定位并解决Triton-Ascend集成中的各类异常。"
msgstr "Based on your specific issues, refer to the corresponding chapters to efficiently locate and resolve exceptions in Triton-Ascend integration."

msgid "1.1 Triton-Ascend常见问题分类与调试指引"
msgstr "1.1 Triton-Ascend Common Issue Classification and Debugging Guide"

msgid "在开发过程中，问题通常可归纳为以下几类。下表提供了快速的问题类型辨识与首选调试方法指引。"
msgstr "During development, problems typically fall into the following categories. The following table provides a quick guide for identifying problem types and preferred debugging methods."

msgid "问题类型"
msgstr "Issue Type"

msgid "典型表现/描述"
msgstr "Typical symptom/description"

msgid "推荐的首要调试方法"
msgstr "Recommended primary debugging method"

msgid "**精度问题**"
msgstr "**Precision issues**"

msgid "NPU运行结果与标杆参考结果（如PyTorch或Triton CPU解释器）存在差异。"
msgstr "The NPU execution results differ from the benchmark reference results (such as PyTorch or the Triton CPU interpreter)."

msgid "[4. 解释器模式](#debug-interpreter-mode)；[5.1打印调试方法](#debug-printing)"
msgstr "[4. Interpreter Mode](#debug-interpreter-mode); [5.1 Print Debugging Method](#debug-printing)"

msgid "**编译错误 (MLIRCompilationError)**"
msgstr "**Compilation error (MLIRCompilationError)**"

msgid "在编译转换阶段失败，通常在Python端抛出 `MLIRCompilationError`。"
msgstr "It fails during the compilation conversion phase and usually raises an `MLIRCompilationError` on the Python side."

