msgstr "[5.2 Compilation Error Debugging Method](#debug-compilation-error)"

msgid "2 Triton-Ascend编译流程概览"
msgstr "2 Triton-Ascend Compilation Process Overview"

msgid "理解完整的编译链是进行有效调试的基础。Triton-Ascend的编译过程包括以下主要阶段："
msgstr "Understanding the complete compilation chain is the foundation for effective debugging. The Triton-Ascend compilation process includes the following main phases:"

