"# Triton-Ascend Compilation Flow Diagram\n"
"[Python Kernel]\n"
"     ↓ (triton.compile)\n"
"[ttir.mlir]\n"
"     ↓        │ (TRITON_DEBUG=1 → ~/.triton/dump/)\n"
"[ttadapter.mlir]\n"
