msgid "**本指南的调试重点**集中在第二阶段：`ttir.mlir` → `ttadapter.mlir` 的转换过程，此阶段是Triton-Ascend的主要功能。"
msgstr "**The debugging focus of this guide** is on the second phase: the `ttir.mlir` → `ttadapter.mlir` conversion process, which is the primary feature of Triton-Ascend."

msgid "3 Triton-Ascend临时文件指引"
msgstr "3 Triton-Ascend Temporary File Guide"

msgid "在Triton-Ascend的编译过程中，系统会生成多种临时文件用于缓存和调试。理解这些文件的位置和用途对于高效调试至关重要。"
msgstr "During the compilation of Triton-Ascend, the system generates multiple temporary files for caching and debugging. To debug efficiently, you must understand the locations and purposes of these files."

msgid "3.1 缓存文件（Cache）"
msgstr "3.1 Cache Files"

msgid "Triton使用缓存机制来加速重复编译过程。编译过程中生成的中间文件会被缓存在用户目录下，避免重复编译相同的kernel。"
msgstr "Triton uses a cache mechanism to accelerate repeated compilation. Intermediate files generated during compilation are cached in the user directory to avoid recompiling the same kernel."

msgid "缓存目录结构："
msgstr "Cache directory structure:"

msgid "默认路径: ~/.triton/cache/"
msgstr "Default path: ~/.triton/cache/"

msgid "主要缓存内容:"
msgstr "Main cache contents:"

msgid "输入文件缓存: 原始Triton kernel生成的ttir.mlir文件"
msgstr "Input file cache: The ttir.mlir file generated by the original Triton kernel"

msgid "输出文件缓存: 经过适配Ascend转换后的ttadapter.mlir文件"
msgstr "Output file cache: the ttadapter.mlir file after Ascend adaptation conversion"

msgid "编译产物缓存: 最终编译生成的可执行文件"
msgstr "Compilation artifact cache: The executable file generated by the final compilation"

msgid "缓存文件命名约定： 缓存文件通常以MD5哈希值命名，确保相同的kernel代码对应相同的缓存文件。"
msgstr "Cache file naming convention: Cache files are typically named using MD5 hash values to ensure that the same kernel code corresponds to the same cache file."

msgid "**缓存管理建议：**"
msgstr "**Cache management recommendations:**"

msgid "定期清理: 缓存可能占用较多磁盘空间，可定期清理："
msgstr "Periodic cleanup: The cache may occupy a large amount of disk space. You can clean it up periodically:"

msgid ""
"rm -rf ~/.triton/cache\n"
msgstr ""
"rm -rf ~/.triton/cache\n"

msgid "调试时禁用缓存: 在调试编译问题时，建议临时禁用缓存以确保每次都重新编译："
msgstr "Disable the cache when debugging: When debugging compilation issues, temporarily disable the cache to ensure that it recompiles every time:"

msgid ""
"export TRITON_ALWAYS_COMPILE=1\n"
msgstr ""
"export TRITON_ALWAYS_COMPILE=1\n"

msgid "缓存验证: 当怀疑缓存导致问题时，可删除相关缓存文件后重新测试。"
msgstr "Cache verification: If you suspect that the cache is causing the problem, delete the related cache files and run the test again."

