msgid "3.4.1 TTIR（Triton Intermediate Representation）"
msgstr "3.4.1 TTIR（Triton Intermediate Representation）"

msgid "TTIR样例 查看kernel.ttir.mlir如下："
msgstr "For the TTIR sample, view kernel.ttir.mlir as follows:"

msgid ""
"module {\n"
"  tt.func public @add_kernel(%arg0: !tt.ptr<f32> {tt.divisibility = 16 : i32} , %arg1: !tt.ptr<f32> {tt.divisibility = 16 : i32} , %arg2: !tt.ptr<f32> {tt.divisibility = 16 : i32} , %arg3: i32 {tt.divisibility = 16 : i32} ) attributes {noinline = false} {\n"
"    %cst = arith.constant dense<0.000000e+00> : tensor<1024xf32> loc(#loc1)\n"
"    %c1024_i32 = arith.constant 1024 : i32 loc(#loc1)\n"
"    %0 = tt.get_program_id x : i32 loc(#loc2)\n"
"    %1 = arith.muli %0, %c1024_i32 : i32 loc(#loc3)\n"
"    %2 = tt.make_range {end = 1024 : i32, start = 0 : i32} : tensor<1024xi32> loc(#loc4)\n"
"    %3 = tt.splat %1 : i32 -> tensor<1024xi32> loc(#loc5)\n"
"    %4 = arith.addi %3, %2 : tensor<1024xi32> loc(#loc5)\n"
"    %5 = tt.splat %arg3 : i32 -> tensor<1024xi32> loc(#loc6)\n"
"    %6 = arith.cmpi slt, %4, %5 : tensor<1024xi32> loc(#loc6)\n"
"    %7 = tt.splat %arg0 : !tt.ptr<f32> -> tensor<1024x!tt.ptr<f32>> loc(#loc7)\n"
"    %8 = tt.addptr %7, %4 : tensor<1024x!tt.ptr<f32>>, tensor<1024xi32> loc(#loc7)\n"
"    %9 = tt.load %8, %6, %cst : tensor<1024x!tt.ptr<f32>> loc(#loc8)\n"
"    %10 = tt.splat %arg1 : !tt.ptr<f32> -> tensor<1024x!tt.ptr<f32>> loc(#loc9)\n"
"    %11 = tt.addptr %10, %4 : tensor<1024x!tt.ptr<f32>>, tensor<1024xi32> loc(#loc9)\n"
"    %12 = tt.load %11, %6, %cst : tensor<1024x!tt.ptr<f32>> loc(#loc10)\n"
"    %13 = arith.addf %9, %12 : tensor<1024xf32> loc(#loc11)\n"
"    %14 = tt.splat %arg2 : !tt.ptr<f32> -> tensor<1024x!tt.ptr<f32>> loc(#loc12)\n"
"    %15 = tt.addptr %14, %4 : tensor<1024x!tt.ptr<f32>>, tensor<1024xi32> loc(#loc12)\n"
"    tt.store %15, %13, %6 : tensor<1024x!tt.ptr<f32>> loc(#loc13)\n"
"    tt.return loc(#loc14)}}\n"
msgstr ""
"module {\n"
"  tt.func public @add_kernel(%arg0: !tt.ptr<f32> {tt.divisibility = 16 : i32} , %arg1: !tt.ptr<f32> {tt.divisibility = 16 : i32} , %arg2: !tt.ptr<f32> {tt.divisibility = 16 : i32} , %arg3: i32 {tt.divisibility = 16 : i32} ) attributes {noinline = false} {\n"
"    %cst = arith.constant dense<0.000000e+00> : tensor<1024xf32> loc(#loc1)\n"
"    %c1024_i32 = arith.constant 1024 : i32 loc(#loc1)\n"
"    %0 = tt.get_program_id x : i32 loc(#loc2)\n"
"    %1 = arith.muli %0, %c1024_i32 : i32 loc(#loc3)\n"
"    %2 = tt.make_range {end = 1024 : i32, start = 0 : i32} : tensor<1024xi32> loc(#loc4)\n"
"    %3 = tt.splat %1 : i32 -> tensor<1024xi32> loc(#loc5)\n"
"    %4 = arith.addi %3, %2 : tensor<1024xi32> loc(#loc5)\n"
"    %5 = tt.splat %arg3 : i32 -> tensor<1024xi32> loc(#loc6)\n"
"    %6 = arith.cmpi slt, %4, %5 : tensor<1024xi32> loc(#loc6)\n"
"    %7 = tt.splat %arg0 : !tt.ptr<f32> -> tensor<1024x!tt.ptr<f32>> loc(#loc7)\n"
"    %8 = tt.addptr %7, %4 : tensor<1024x!tt.ptr<f32>>, tensor<1024xi32> loc(#loc7)\n"
"    %9 = tt.load %8, %6, %cst : tensor<1024x!tt.ptr<f32>> loc(#loc8)\n"
"    %10 = tt.splat %arg1 : !tt.ptr<f32> -> tensor<1024x!tt.ptr<f32>> loc(#loc9)\n"
"    %11 = tt.addptr %10, %4 : tensor<1024x!tt.ptr<f32>>, tensor<1024xi32> loc(#loc9)\n"
"    %12 = tt.load %11, %6, %cst : tensor<1024x!tt.ptr<f32>> loc(#loc10)\n"
"    %13 = arith.addf %9, %12 : tensor<1024xf32> loc(#loc11)\n"
"    %14 = tt.splat %arg2 : !tt.ptr<f32> -> tensor<1024x!tt.ptr<f32>> loc(#loc12)\n"
"    %15 = tt.addptr %14, %4 : tensor<1024x!tt.ptr<f32>>, tensor<1024xi32> loc(#loc12)\n"
"    tt.store %15, %13, %6 : tensor<1024x!tt.ptr<f32>> loc(#loc13)\n"
"    tt.return loc(#loc14)}}\n"

msgid "TTIR解析"
msgstr "TTIR Parsing"

msgid "TTIR是Triton编译器前端生成的中间表示（Intermediate Representation），它以MLIR（Multi-Level IR）格式表达，保留了原始Triton Python内核的语义结构。在 `kernel.ttir.mlir` 中："
msgstr "TTIR is the intermediate representation generated by the Triton compiler frontend. It is expressed in MLIR (Multi-Level IR) format and preserves the semantic structure of the original Triton Python kernel. In `kernel.ttir.mlir`:"

msgid "函数 `@add_kernel` 接收三个指针参数（分别对应输入A、B和输出C的设备内存地址）以及一个整型参数 `n` 表示向量长度。"
msgstr "The function `@add_kernel` takes three pointer parameters (corresponding to the device memory addresses of inputs A and B and output C, respectively) and an integer parameter `n` that represents the vector length."

msgid "每个Triton program (向量化执行单元) 处理1024个元素（由 `%c1024_i32` 常量体现），通过 `tt.get_program_id x` 获取当前block的ID，并计算其全局偏移。"
msgstr "Each Triton program (vectorized execution unit) processes 1024 elements (represented by the `%c1024_i32` constant), obtains the current block ID using `tt.get_program_id x`, and calculates its global offset."

msgid "使用 `tt.make_range` 与 `tt.splat` 构造SIMD风格的索引张量，配合 `arith.addi` 生成每个线程处理的全局地址偏移。"
msgstr "Use `tt.make_range` and `tt.splat` to construct SIMD-style index tensors, and use `arith.addi` to generate the global address offsets processed by each thread."

msgid "通过 `tt.addptr` 和 `tt.load` 实现向量化加载，使用掩码 `%6`（由 `arith.cmpi slt` 生成）防止越界访问。"
msgstr "Vectorized loading is implemented using `tt.addptr` and `tt.load`, and applies the mask `%6` (generated by `arith.cmpi slt`) to prevent out-of-bounds access."

msgid "执行逐元素浮点加法 `arith.addf`，再通过 `tt.store` 将结果写回全局内存。"
msgstr "Execute the element-wise floating-point addition `arith.addf`, and then write the result back to global memory using `tt.store`."

msgid "TTIR层面仍基于Triton原生抽象（如 `!tt.ptr<f32>`、`tt.load`/`tt.store` 等），尚未映射到底层硬件的具体内存模型或执行单元，是平台无关的高层次IR。"
msgstr "At the TTIR level, the IR is still based on Triton native abstractions (such as `!tt.ptr<f32>`, `tt.load`/`tt.store`). It has not yet been mapped to the specific memory model or execution units of the underlying hardware, making it a platform-independent high-level IR."

msgid "3.4.2 TTAdapter IR（Target-Specific Adapter Representation）"
msgstr "3.4.2 TTAdapter IR（Target-Specific Adapter Representation）"

msgid "TTAdapter IR样例 查看kernel.ttadapter.mlir如下："
msgstr "TTAdapter IR sample: View the kernel.ttadapter.mlir file as follows:"

msgid ""
"module {\n"
"  func.func @add_kernel(%arg0: memref<?xi8>, %arg1: memref<?xi8>, %arg2: memref<?xf32> {tt.divisibility = 16 : i32, tt.tensor_kind = 0 : i32}, %arg3: memref<?xf32> {tt.divisibility = 16 : i32, tt.tensor_kind = 0 : i32}, %arg4: memref<?xf32> {tt.divisibility = 16 : i32, tt.tensor_kind = 1 : i32}, %arg5: i32 {tt.divisibility = 16 : i32}, %arg6: i32, %arg7: i32, %arg8: i32, %arg9: i32, %arg10: i32, %arg11: i32) attributes {SyncBlockLockArgIdx = 0 : i64, WorkspaceArgIdx = 1 : i64, global_kernel = \"local\", mix_mode = \"aiv\", parallel_mode = \"simd\"} {\n"
"    %cst = arith.constant 0.000000e+00 : f32\n"
"    %c1024 = arith.constant 1024 : index\n"
"    %c1024_i32 = arith.constant 1024 : i32\n"
"    %0 = arith.muli %arg9, %c1024_i32 : i32\n"
"    %1 = arith.index_cast %0 : i32 to index\n"
"    %reinterpret_cast = memref.reinterpret_cast %arg2 to offset: [%1], sizes: [1024], strides: [1] : memref<?xf32> to memref<1024xf32, strided<[1], offset: ?>>\n"
"    %alloc = memref.alloc() : memref<1024xf32>\n"
"    %2 = arith.addi %1, %c1024 : index\n"
"    %3 = arith.index_cast %arg5 : i32 to index\n"
"    %4 = arith.maxsi %1, %3 : index\n"
"    %5 = arith.minsi %2, %4 : index\n"
"    %6 = arith.subi %5, %1 : index\n"
"    %7 = arith.cmpi slt, %6, %c1024 : index\n"
"    scf.if %7 {\n"
"      linalg.fill ins(%cst : f32) outs(%alloc : memref<1024xf32>)\n"
"    } {hivm.unlikely_condition}\n"
"    %subview = memref.subview %reinterpret_cast[0] [%6] [1] : memref<1024xf32, strided<[1], offset: ?>> to memref<?xf32, strided<[1], offset: ?>>\n"
"    %subview_0 = memref.subview %alloc[0] [%6] [1] : memref<1024xf32> to memref<?xf32, strided<[1]>>\n"
"    memref.copy %subview, %subview_0 : memref<?xf32, strided<[1], offset: ?>> to memref<?xf32, strided<[1]>>\n"
"    %8 = bufferization.to_tensor %alloc restrict writable : memref<1024xf32>\n"
"    %reinterpret_cast_1 = memref.reinterpret_cast %arg3 to offset: [%1], sizes: [1024], strides: [1] : memref<?xf32> to memref<1024xf32, strided<[1], offset: ?>>\n"
"    %alloc_2 = memref.alloc() : memref<1024xf32>\n"
"    scf.if %7 {\n"
"      linalg.fill ins(%cst : f32) outs(%alloc_2 : memref<1024xf32>)\n"
"    } {hivm.unlikely_condition}\n"
"    %subview_3 = memref.subview %reinterpret_cast_1[0] [%6] [1] : memref<1024xf32, strided<[1], offset: ?>> to memref<?xf32, strided<[1], offset: ?>>\n"
"    %subview_4 = memref.subview %alloc_2[0] [%6] [1] : memref<1024xf32> to memref<?xf32, strided<[1]>>\n"
"    memref.copy %subview_3, %subview_4 : memref<?xf32, strided<[1], offset: ?>> to memref<?xf32, strided<[1]>>\n"
"    %9 = bufferization.to_tensor %alloc_2 restrict writable : memref<1024xf32>\n"
"    %10 = arith.addf %8, %9 : tensor<1024xf32>\n"
"    %reinterpret_cast_5 = memref.reinterpret_cast %arg4 to offset: [%1], sizes: [1024], strides: [1] : memref<?xf32> to memref<1024xf32, strided<[1], offset: ?>>\n"
"    %extracted_slice = tensor.extract_slice %10[0] [%6] [1] : tensor<1024xf32> to tensor<?xf32>\n"
"    %subview_6 = memref.subview %reinterpret_cast_5[0] [%6] [1] : memref<1024xf32, strided<[1], offset: ?>> to memref<?xf32, strided<[1], offset: ?>>\n"
"    bufferization.materialize_in_destination %extracted_slice in writable %subview_6 : (tensor<?xf32>, memref<?xf32, strided<[1], offset: ?>>) -> ()\n"
"    return\n"
"  }\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""
"module {\n"
"  func.func @add_kernel(%arg0: memref<?xi8>, %arg1: memref<?xi8>, %arg2: memref<?xf32> {tt.divisibility = 16 : i32, tt.tensor_kind = 0 : i32}, %arg3: memref<?xf32> {tt.divisibility = 16 : i32, tt.tensor_kind = 0 : i32}, %arg4: memref<?xf32> {tt.divisibility = 16 : i32, tt.tensor_kind = 1 : i32}, %arg5: i32 {tt.divisibility = 16 : i32}, %arg6: i32, %arg7: i32, %arg8: i32, %arg9: i32, %arg10: i32, %arg11: i32) attributes {SyncBlockLockArgIdx = 0 : i64, WorkspaceArgIdx = 1 : i64, global_kernel = \"local\", mix_mode = \"aiv\", parallel_mode = \"simd\"} {\n"
"    %cst = arith.constant 0.000000e+00 : f32\n"
"    %c1024 = arith.constant 1024 : index\n"
"    %c1024_i32 = arith.constant 1024 : i32\n"
"    %0 = arith.muli %arg9, %c1024_i32 : i32\n"
"    %1 = arith.index_cast %0 : i32 to index\n"
"    %reinterpret_cast = memref.reinterpret_cast %arg2 to offset: [%1], sizes: [1024], strides: [1] : memref<?xf32> to memref<1024xf32, strided<[1], offset: ?>>\n"
"    %alloc = memref.alloc() : memref<1024xf32>\n"
"    %2 = arith.addi %1, %c1024 : index\n"
"    %3 = arith.index_cast %arg5 : i32 to index\n"
"    %4 = arith.maxsi %1, %3 : index\n"
"    %5 = arith.minsi %2, %4 : index\n"
"    %6 = arith.subi %5, %1 : index\n"
"    %7 = arith.cmpi slt, %6, %c1024 : index\n"
"    scf.if %7 {\n"
"      linalg.fill ins(%cst : f32) outs(%alloc : memref<1024xf32>)\n"
"    } {hivm.unlikely_condition}\n"
"    %subview = memref.subview %reinterpret_cast[0] [%6] [1] : memref<1024xf32, strided<[1], offset: ?>> to memref<?xf32, strided<[1], offset: ?>>\n"
"    %subview_0 = memref.subview %alloc[0] [%6] [1] : memref<1024xf32> to memref<?xf32, strided<[1]>>\n"
"    memref.copy %subview, %subview_0 : memref<?xf32, strided<[1], offset: ?>> to memref<?xf32, strided<[1]>>\n"
"    %8 = bufferization.to_tensor %alloc restrict writable : memref<1024xf32>\n"
"    %reinterpret_cast_1 = memref.reinterpret_cast %arg3 to offset: [%1], sizes: [1024], strides: [1] : memref<?xf32> to memref<1024xf32, strided<[1], offset: ?>>\n"
"    %alloc_2 = memref.alloc() : memref<1024xf32>\n"
"    scf.if %7 {\n"
"      linalg.fill ins(%cst : f32) outs(%alloc_2 : memref<1024xf32>)\n"
"    } {hivm.unlikely_condition}\n"
"    %subview_3 = memref.subview %reinterpret_cast_1[0] [%6] [1] : memref<1024xf32, strided<[1], offset: ?>> to memref<?xf32, strided<[1], offset: ?>>\n"
"    %subview_4 = memref.subview %alloc_2[0] [%6] [1] : memref<1024xf32> to memref<?xf32, strided<[1]>>\n"
"    memref.copy %subview_3, %subview_4 : memref<?xf32, strided<[1], offset: ?>> to memref<?xf32, strided<[1]>>\n"
"    %9 = bufferization.to_tensor %alloc_2 restrict writable : memref<1024xf32>\n"
"    %10 = arith.addf %8, %9 : tensor<1024xf32>\n"
"    %reinterpret_cast_5 = memref.reinterpret_cast %arg4 to offset: [%1], sizes: [1024], strides: [1] : memref<?xf32> to memref<1024xf32, strided<[1], offset: ?>>\n"
"    %extracted_slice = tensor.extract_slice %10[0] [%6] [1] : tensor<1024xf32> to tensor<?xf32>\n"
"    %subview_6 = memref.subview %reinterpret_cast_5[0] [%6] [1] : memref<1024xf32, strided<[1], offset: ?>> to memref<?xf32, strided<[1], offset: ?>>\n"
"    bufferization.materialize_in_destination %extracted_slice in writable %subview_6 : (tensor<?xf32>, memref<?xf32, strided<[1], offset: ?>>) -> ()\n"
"    return\n"
"  }\n"
"}\n"

msgid "TTAdapter IR解析"
msgstr "TTAdapter IR Parsing"

msgid "TTAdapter IR是Triton-Ascend编译流程中将TTIR转换为适配昇腾NPU架构的中间表示，采用标准MLIR dialect（如 `memref`、`linalg`、`scf` 等），并引入NPU特定的约束和优化策略。在 `kernel.ttadapter.mlir` 中："
msgstr "TTAdapter IR is an intermediate representation in the Triton-Ascend compilation process that converts TTIR to adapt to the Ascend NPU architecture. It uses standard MLIR dialects (such as `memref`, `linalg`, and `scf`) and introduces NPU-specific constraints and optimization strategies. In `kernel.ttadapter.mlir`:"

msgid "函数签名已从Triton指针类型转换为 `memref<?xi8>` 或带属性的 `memref<?xf32>`，其中 `tt.divisibility = 16` 表示内存对齐要求，`tt.tensor_kind` 区分输入（0）与输出（1）。"
msgstr "The function signature is converted from the Triton pointer type to `memref<?xi8>` or `memref<?xf32>` with attributes. The `tt.divisibility = 16` attribute indicates the memory alignment requirement, and the `tt.tensor_kind` attribute distinguishes input (0) from output (1)."

msgid "全局偏移通过 `memref.reinterpret_cast` 重构为固定大小（1024）的局部视图，便于后续向量化处理。"
msgstr "The global offset is reconstructed into a fixed-size (1024) local view using `memref.reinterpret_cast` to facilitate subsequent vectorized processing."

msgid "引入边界检查逻辑：计算有效元素数量 `%6`，并通过 `scf.if` 控制是否对尾部填充零（`linalg.fill`），确保SIMD宽度对齐且不越界。"
msgstr "Introduce boundary check logic: calculate the number of valid elements `%6`, and use `scf.if` to control whether to fill the tail with zeros (`linalg.fill`), ensuring SIMD width alignment and preventing out-of-bounds access."

msgid "使用 `memref.alloc` 分配本地暂存buffer，通过 `memref.copy` 将全局内存数据安全拷贝至本地，再经 `bufferization.to_tensor` 转为tensor供算子使用。"
msgstr "Use `memref.alloc` to allocate a local temporary buffer. Use `memref.copy` to safely copy global memory data to the local buffer. Then, use `bufferization.to_tensor` to convert it to a tensor for the operator to use."

msgid "加法操作由 `arith.addf` 在tensor上执行，结果通过 `tensor.extract_slice` 截取有效部分，并用 `bufferization.materialize_in_destination` 写回目标memref。"
msgstr "The `arith.addf` operation performs addition on the tensor, `tensor.extract_slice` extracts the valid part, and `bufferization.materialize_in_destination` writes it back to the target memref."

msgid "TTAdapter IR已完成从Triton抽象到适配昇腾NPU的格式转换。"
msgstr "TTAdapter IR completes the format conversion from the Triton abstraction to the Ascend NPU-adapted format."

msgid "<a id=\"debug-interpreter-mode\"></a>"
msgstr "<a id=\"debug-interpreter-mode\"></a>"

msgid "<a id=\"debug-interpreter-mode\">"
msgstr "<a id=\"debug-interpreter-mode\">"

msgid "4 解释器模式"
msgstr "4 Interpreter Mode"

msgid "解释器的核心价值在于**隔离硬件差异**。通过环境变量 `TRITON_INTERPRET=1` 强制Triton在CPU上执行kernel计算，其结果可作为判断NPU计算精度的基准。"
msgstr "The core value of the interpreter lies in **isolating hardware differences**. By setting the environment variable `TRITON_INTERPRET=1`, you can force Triton to execute kernel computations on the CPU. These results serve as a baseline for evaluating NPU computation accuracy."

msgid "**使用方法：**"
msgstr "**Usage:**"

msgid "在Triton kernel源码中需要检查的位置插入Python断点："
msgstr "Insert a Python breakpoint at the location you need to check in the Triton kernel source code:"

msgid ""
"breakpoint()  # Python内置断点函数\n"
msgstr ""
"breakpoint()  # Python built-in breakpoint function\n"

msgid "设置环境变量 `TRITON_INTERPRET=1` 并运行程序，使Triton kernel在CPU解释器上执行。"
msgstr "Set the environment variable `TRITON_INTERPRET=1` and run the program to execute the Triton kernel on the CPU interpreter."

msgid "程序执行到此处会暂停并进入Python调试器 (`Pdb`)。可以打印和检查任意中间变量的值："
msgstr "Program execution pauses here and enters the Python debugger (`Pdb`). You can print and inspect the values of any intermediate variables:"

msgid ""
"(Pdb) p tmp0  # 打印变量tmp0的值\n"
msgstr ""
"(Pdb) p tmp0  # Print the value of variable tmp0\n"

msgid "注：解释器模式会在CPU上执行所有计算，显著降低运行效率。因此，在完成调试或验证后，务必取消设置环境变量 `TRITON_INTERPRET`，或显式将其设为0，确保系统性能不受影响："
msgstr "Note: Interpreter mode executes all computations on the CPU, significantly reducing performance. Therefore, after debugging or verification, you must unset the `TRITON_INTERPRET` environment variable or explicitly set it to 0 to ensure system performance is not affected:"

msgid ""
"# 取消该环境变量\n"
"unset TRITON_INTERPRET\n"
"\n"
"# 显式将其设为0\n"
"export TRITON_INTERPRET=0\n"
msgstr ""
"# Unset this environment variable\n"
"unset TRITON_INTERPRET\n"
"\n"
"# Explicitly set it to 0\n"
"export TRITON_INTERPRET=0\n"

msgid "5 调试方法"
msgstr "5 Debugging Methods"

msgid "<a id=\"debug-printing\"></a>"
msgstr "<a id=\"debug-printing\"></a>"

msgid "<a id=\"debug-printing\">"
msgstr "<a id=\"debug-printing\">"

msgid "5.1 打印调试方法"
msgstr "5.1 Print Debugging Method"

msgid "5.1.1 静态打印调试方法"
msgstr "5.1.1 Static Print Debugging Method"

msgid "此方法使用 `tl.static_print` 在编译时打印常量表达式的值，适用于调试编译时已知的配置参数和常量。"
msgstr "This method uses `tl.static_print` to print the value of a constant expression at compile time. It is suitable for debugging configuration parameters and constants known at compile time."

msgid "设置环境变量 `TRITON_DEVICE_PRINT=1` 可启用 `tl.static_print` 功能。此函数允许在kernel编译阶段打印常量值，是验证配置参数和常量表达式的有效方法。"
msgstr "Set the environment variable `TRITON_DEVICE_PRINT=1` to enable the `tl.static_print` function. This function prints constant values during kernel compilation. It is an effective method for verifying configuration parameters and constant expressions."

msgid "特性说明："
msgstr "Feature description:"

msgid "tl.static_print在编译时执行，而不是运行时"
msgstr "`tl.static_print` executes at compile time, not at runtime."

msgid "只能打印编译时常量（tl.constexpr参数、常量表达式）"
msgstr "You can only print compile-time constants (tl.constexpr parameters and constant expressions)."

msgid "输出显示在编译器的标准输出中"
msgstr "The output appears in the standard output of the compiler."

msgid "使用方法："
msgstr "Usage:"

msgid "1.在Triton kernel中，为需要调试的常量参数添加tl.static_print语句"
msgstr "1\\. In the Triton kernel, add a tl.static_print statement for the constant parameters that require debugging."

msgid ""
"import triton\n"
"import triton.language as tl\n"
"\n"
"@triton.jit\n"
"def triton_kernel(\n"
"    out_ptr0,\n"
"    in_ptr0,\n"
"    in_ptr1,\n"
"    XBLOCK: tl.constexpr,  # 编译时常量参数\n"
"    USE_FP16: tl.constexpr  # 编译时常量参数\n"
"):\n"
"    # 打印编译时常量参数\n"
"    tl.static_print(\"XBLOCK = \", XBLOCK)\n"
"    tl.static_print(\"USE_FP16 = \", USE_FP16)\n"
"\n"
"    idx = tl.arange(0, XBLOCK)\n"
"    tmp0 = tl.load(in_ptr0 + idx)\n"
"    tmp1 = tl.load(in_ptr1 + idx)\n"
"\n"
"    # 打印常量计算结果\n"
"    elements_per_thread = XBLOCK // 32\n"
"    tl.static_print(\"Elements per thread = \", elements_per_thread)\n"
"\n"
"    tmp2 = tmp0 + tmp1\n"
"    tl.store(out_ptr0 + idx, tmp2)\n"
msgstr ""
"import triton\n"
"import triton.language as tl\n"
"\n"
"@triton.jit\n"
"def triton_kernel(\n"
"    out_ptr0,\n"
"    in_ptr0,\n"
"    in_ptr1,\n"
"    XBLOCK: tl.constexpr,  # Compile-time constant parameter\n"
"    USE_FP16: tl.constexpr  # Compile-time constant parameter\n"
"):\n"
"    # Print compile-time constant parameters\n"
"    tl.static_print(\"XBLOCK = \", XBLOCK)\n"
"    tl.static_print(\"USE_FP16 = \", USE_FP16)\n"
"\n"
"    idx = tl.arange(0, XBLOCK)\n"
"    tmp0 = tl.load(in_ptr0 + idx)\n"
"    tmp1 = tl.load(in_ptr1 + idx)\n"
"\n"
"    # Print constant computation results\n"
"    elements_per_thread = XBLOCK // 32\n"
"    tl.static_print(\"Elements per thread = \", elements_per_thread)\n"
"\n"
"    tmp2 = tmp0 + tmp1\n"
"    tl.store(out_ptr0 + idx, tmp2)\n"

msgid "2.设置环境变量并运行程序进行编译"
msgstr "2\\. Set the environment variables and run the program to compile it."

msgid ""
"# 启用Triton调试输出（包含static_print）\n"
"export TRITON_DEVICE_PRINT=1\n"
"\n"
"# 运行Python程序，会在编译阶段看到打印输出\n"
"python your_program.py\n"
msgstr ""
"# Enable Triton debugging output (including static_print)\n"
"export TRITON_DEVICE_PRINT=1\n"
"\n"
"# Run the Python program. The print output appears during the compilation phase.\n"
"python your_program.py\n"

msgid "5.1.2 运行时调试方法"
msgstr "5.1.2 Runtime debugging methods"

msgid "此方法使用 `tl.device_print` 时可以灵活打印需要观察的变量的值。 设置环境变量 `TRITON_DEVICE_PRINT=1` 可启用 `tl.device_print` 功能。此函数允许在kernel内部打印张量值，是分阶段验证计算精度的高效方法。 **使用方法：**"
msgstr "When using `tl.device_print`, this method allows you to flexibly print the values of the variables you want to observe. Set the environment variable `TRITON_DEVICE_PRINT=1` to enable the `tl.device_print` function. This function allows you to print tensor values inside a kernel. It is an efficient method for verifying computation accuracy in stages. **Usage:**"

msgid "在Triton kernel中，为需要打印的变量增加 `tl.device_print` 的语句。"
msgstr "In the Triton kernel, add a `tl.device_print` statement for the variables you need to print."

msgid ""
"import triton\n"
"import triton.language as tl\n"
"\n"
"@triton.jit\n"
"def triton_kernel(out_ptr0, in_ptr0, in_ptr1, XBLOCK: tl.constexpr):\n"
"    idx = tl.arange(0, XBLOCK)\n"
"    tmp0 = tl.load(in_ptr0 + idx)\n"
"    tmp1 = tl.load(in_ptr1 + idx)\n"
"    tmp2 = tmp0 + tmp1\n"
"    tl.device_print(\"tmp2 after addition = \", tmp2)  # 打印中间结果\n"
"    tl.store(out_ptr0 + idx, tmp2)\n"
msgstr ""
"import triton\n"
"import triton.language as tl\n"
"\n"
"@triton.jit\n"
"def triton_kernel(out_ptr0, in_ptr0, in_ptr1, XBLOCK: tl.constexpr):\n"
"    idx = tl.arange(0, XBLOCK)\n"
"    tmp0 = tl.load(in_ptr0 + idx)\n"
"    tmp1 = tl.load(in_ptr1 + idx)\n"
"    tmp2 = tmp0 + tmp1\n"
"    tl.device_print(\"tmp2 after addition = \", tmp2)  # Print the intermediate result\n"
"    tl.store(out_ptr0 + idx, tmp2)\n"

msgid "2.设置环境变量`TRITON_DEVICE_PRINT=1`并运行程序，窗口将打印出该变量的值。"
msgstr "2\\. Set the environment variable `TRITON_DEVICE_PRINT=1` and run the program. The window prints the value of this variable."

msgid ""
"# 启用Triton调试输出（包含device_print）\n"
"export TRITON_DEVICE_PRINT=1\n"
"\n"
"# 运行Python程序，会在运行阶段看到打印输出\n"
"python your_program.py\n"
msgstr ""
"# Enable Triton debugging output (including device_print)\n"
"export TRITON_DEVICE_PRINT=1\n"
"\n"
"# Run the Python program, and you see the print output at runtime\n"
"python your_program.py\n"

msgid "运行后，`tl.device_print` 打印的变量内容会显示在 `HiIPU Print` 区块内，示例如下："
msgstr "After execution, the variable content printed by `tl.device_print` is displayed in the `HiIPU Print` block. An example is as follows:"

msgid ""
"-----------------------------------------------------------------------------\n"
"---------------------------------HiIPU Print---------------------------------\n"
"-----------------------------------------------------------------------------\n"
"=> Vec 0\n"
" tmp2 after addition =:\n"
"[1.000000,2.000000,3.000000,4.000000,5.000000,6.000000,7.000000,8.000000,9.000000,10.000000,11.000000,12.000000,13.000000,14.000000,15.000000,16.000000]\n"
msgstr ""
"-----------------------------------------------------------------------------\n"
"---------------------------------HiIPU Print---------------------------------\n"
"-----------------------------------------------------------------------------\n"
"=> Vec 0\n"
" tmp2 after addition =:\n"
"[1.000000,2.000000,3.000000,4.000000,5.000000,6.000000,7.000000,8.000000,9.000000,10.000000,11.000000,12.000000,13.000000,14.000000,15.000000,16.000000]\n"

